    "text": "International Workplace Group plc - Transaction in Own Shares\n\n\n04 September 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nInternational Workplace Group plc\n\n\nTransaction in Own Shares\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nInternational Workplace Group plc (the 'Company') announces the purchase, in accordance with the authority granted by shareholders at the Company's Annual General Meeting on 19 May 2026, of 172,000 ordinary shares of USD 0.0124 each in the capital of the Company (the 'Shares') on 03 September 2026 as part of the buyback programme announced on 31 December 2025 (the 'Programme').\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Company intends to cancel the Shares or keep them in Treasury.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSince the announcement of the programme on 31 December 2025 (the 'Programme'), the Company has purchased a total of 50,295,063 ordinary shares of USD 0.0124 each in the capital of the Company.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFollowing purchase of the Shares, the Company will have 944,079,314 shares in issue (excluding treasury shares).\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe table below contains detailed information about the purchases referred to above.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSchedule of purchases\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nShares purchased:\n\nInternational Workplace Group plc (ISIN: JE00BYVQYS01)\n\n\nDate of purchases:\n\n03 September 2026\n\n\nInvestment firm:\n\nJefferies International Limited\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAggregate information\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVenue\nAggregated number of ordinary shares purchased\nVolume-weighted average price per share (£)\nLowest price per share (£)\nHighest price per share (£)\n\n\nLondon Stock Exchange\n96,099\n1.8470\n1.8100\n1.8660\n\n\nCBOE CXE\n19,368\n1.8474\n1.8110\n1.8640\n\n\nCBOE BXE\n42,030\n1.8477\n1.8110\n1.8620\n\n\nTurquoise Services Limited\n8,014\n1.8472\n1.8130\n1.8630\n\n\nAquis Exchange\n6,489\n1.8464\n1.8130\n1.8630\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIn accordance with Article 5(1)(b) of the Market Abuse Regulation (EU) No 596/2014 (